*.txt
# ...but not the guidebook's toolchain pins. The rule above is for packaged artifacts and
# swallowed this silently: the file existed, `git status` never mentioned it because it was
# ignored, and the Pages deploy failed on a checkout that did not contain it.
!docs/requirements.txt

# virtual machine crash logs, see http://www.java.com/en/download/help/error_hotspot.xml
